y 2026. This has been fully accounted for to preserve the strict continuity of the 12-month timeline (September 2025 through August 2026)."]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"3d308f30","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.002754,"end_time":"2026-09-13T14:00:45.94112+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-09-13T14:00:45.938366+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["**Data Integrity and Cleaning Process (Process Phase Logging):**\n","To ensure the data is reliable, credible, and free of errors, the following technical pipeline is executed within the notebook cells below:\n","* **Data Integration & Uniformity:** Importing multiple CSV data files and standardizing column structures to combine them into a unified Pandas DataFrame.\n","* **Handling Missing Values & Blanks:** Scanning for null entries, empty strings, and structural anomalies to prevent calculation distortion.\n","* **Removing Duplicates:** Filtering out duplicate trip entries to maintain high data integrity.\n","* **Data Transformation:** Engineering new analytical columns—specifically `ride_length` (calculating trip duration by subtracting start time from end time) and `day_of_week` (identifying the specific day each ride initiated)—to enable deep exploratory analysis."]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":3,"id":"f9e21711","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-09-13T14:00:45.948236Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-09-13T14:00:45.947905Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-09-13T14:01:11.276032Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-09-13T14:01:11.274574Z"},"papermill":{"duration":25.334721,"end_time":"2026-09-13T14:01:11.278563+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-09-13T14:00:45.943842+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":["Total rows before cleaning: 6115982\n","Total rows after cleaning and removing duplicates/nulls: 6115918\n"]},{"data":{"text/html":["<div>\n","<style scoped>\n","    .dataframe tbody tr th:only-of-type {\n",