al members exhibit stable weekday commuting trends."]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"60e65b90","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.004219,"end_time":"2026-09-13T14:01:32.991262+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-09-13T14:01:32.987043+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["## 4. Conclusion\n","*Key Takeaways:* \n","\n","The 12-month historical data analysis reveals distinct usage patterns: annual members primarily utilize bikes for weekday commuting (peaking mid-week), whereas casual riders predominantly use bikes for longer leisure and recreational trips during weekends. Addressing these distinct behavioral gaps provides a clear roadmap for targeted marketing interventions.\n"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"fe60799b","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.003955,"end_time":"2026-09-13T14:01:32.999355+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-09-13T14:01:32.9954+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["## 5. Next Steps\n","\n","*Recommendations:*\n","\n","1. Launch targeted weekend digital promotions within the Cyclistic app targeting frequent casual riders.\n","2. Introduce a transitional \"Leisure-to-Member\" pass that credits weekend ride fees toward an annual membership.\n","3. Partner with local Chicago recreational hubs for digital QR-code marketing campaigns.\n","   \n","*Action Plan:*\n","\n","The marketing analytics team will collaborate with Lily Moreno to design the campaign wireframes over the next two weeks, with the pilot digital rollout scheduled for the upcoming quarter to measure conversion rates."]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"8a5e5e24","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.003939,"end_time":"2026-09-13T14:01:33.007223+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-09-13T14:01:33.003284+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------  "]}],"metadata":{"kaggle":{"accelerator":"none","dataSources":[{"sourceType":"datas